{"title": "Cull the Weak (Drider)", "pageid": 32765, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cull_the_Weak_(Drider)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the tadpole power, see <a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\">Cull the Weak</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Physical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp/300px-Generic_Physical.webp, /w/images/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp/300px-Generic_Physical.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Cull the Weak</b> is a passive feature that causes the user to deal additional Slashing damage to seriously wounded targets.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage to targets below 50% of their maximum hit points. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The additional damage also applies to an attack that lowers the target's hitpoints below 50%.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">+2d6 damage to targets below 50% HP.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232643\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 756/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5103/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2922/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 139/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643740/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.803      1 -total\n 98.73%   32.385      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 36.29%   11.905      1 Template:DamageText\n 32.45%   10.645      1 Template:Damage_type\n 31.52%   10.339      1 Template:Icon_link